msgstr "¿Te gusta CineMosaic?"

msgid "Buy me a coffee"
msgstr "Invítame a un café"

msgid "If you use CineMosaic and like it, I would be glad if you bought me a coffee."
msgstr "Si usas CineMosaic y te gusta, me alegraría que me invitaras a un café."

